<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Transmission Not Found — $GFOF Galactic Federation of Finance</title>
<meta name="description" content="The transmission you requested does not exist on Federation channels. Return to galacticfederation.co.">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow">
<link rel="icon" href="/logo.png" type="image/png">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@400;700;900&family=Rajdhani:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#040818;--bg-2:#020510;
  --gold:#F0C040;--gold-2:#FFE880;--gold-3:#C08020;
  --green:#3DFFA0;--cyan:#40C0FF;--purple:#A78BFA;--red:#FF5E7B;
  --text:#DEE2F5;--text-dim:#A9B0CC;--muted:#6A7294;
  --line:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  --orb:'Orbitron',sans-serif;--raj:'Rajdhani',sans-serif;--mono:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:var(--raj);
  font-weight:400;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.6;min-height:100vh;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  overflow-x:hidden;position:relative;
}
body::before{
  content:'';position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-3;pointer-events:none;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 20%,rgba(255,94,123,0.06),transparent 55%),
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 80%,rgba(64,192,255,0.04),transparent 55%),
    linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg) 0%,var(--bg-2) 100%);
}
body::after{
  content:'';position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:1000;pointer-events:none;
  background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 0,rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 1px,transparent 1px,transparent 3px);
  mix-blend-mode:overlay;
}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}

.top-nav{
  position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;
  background:rgba(4,8,24,0.85);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  padding:14px 24px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;
}
.top-nav-brand{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
  font-family:var(--orb);font-size:16px;font-weight:900;
  color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:2px;
  text-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(240,192,64,0.3);
}
.top-nav-brand-icon{
  width:26px;height:26px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold-2),var(--gold),var(--gold-3));
  clip-path:polygon(50% 0%,100% 25%,100% 75%,50% 100%,0% 75%,0% 25%);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:11px;color:#040818;font-weight:900;
}
.top-nav-links{display:flex;gap:8px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.top-nav-links a{
  padding:6px 12px;color:var(--text-dim);
  border:1px solid var(--line);transition:all .2s;border-radius:2px;
}
.top-nav-links a:hover{color:var(--gold);border-color:rgba(240,192,64,0.3);background:rgba(240,192,64,0.05)}
.top-nav-links a.primary{color:var(--green);border-color:rgba(61,255,160,0.3);background:rgba(61,255,160,0.05)}

.stage{
  flex:1;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  padding:60px 24px;
}

.stage-inner{
  max-width:680px;width:100%;
  text-align:center;
}

.error-code{
  font-family:var(--orb);font-weight:900;
  font-size:clamp(96px,18vw,176px);
  line-height:0.9;letter-spacing:-3px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold-2),var(--gold),var(--gold-3));
  -webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
  background-clip:text;
  text-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(240,192,64,0.15);
  margin-bottom:8px;
  position:relative;
  display:inline-block;
}
.error-code::before{
  content:'404';
  position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;
  -webkit-text-fill-color:rgba(255,94,123,0.05);
  filter:blur(8px);
  transform:translate(2px,2px);
}

.error-tag{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;
  color:var(--red);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,94,123,0.3);
  background:rgba(255,94,123,0.04);
  padding:7px 14px;
  margin-bottom:28px;
  clip-path:polygon(8px 0,100% 0,calc(100% - 8px) 100%,0 100%);
}
.error-tag::before{content:'⚠';font-size:13px}

h1.headline{
  font-family:var(--orb);font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,42px);
  font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.5px;line-height:1.15;
  margin-bottom:18px;color:var(--text);
}

p.lede{
  font-size:17px;color:var(--text-dim);
  max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 32px;line-height:1.6;
}
p.lede strong{color:var(--text)}

.transmission{
  margin:32px auto 36px;
  padding:18px 24px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;
  color:var(--text-dim);
  text-align:left;
  max-width:560px;
  line-height:1.7;
  clip-path:polygon(0 0,calc(100% - 12px) 0,100% 12px,100% 100%,12px 100%,0 calc(100% - 12px));
}
.transmission .line{display:block}
.transmission .ts{color:var(--muted)}
.transmission .ok{color:var(--green)}
.transmission .err{color:var(--red)}
.transmission .ic{color:var(--cyan)}

.actions{
  display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;
  margin-top:24px;
}
.btn{
  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;
  padding:11px 20px;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  color:var(--text-dim);
  transition:all .2s;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
  border-radius:2px;
  cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
}
.btn:hover{color:var(--gold);border-color:rgba(240,192,64,0.3);background:rgba(240,192,64,0.05)}
.btn.primary{
  color:var(--gold);
  border-color:rgba(240,192,64,0.4);
  background:rgba(240,192,64,0.08);
}
.btn.primary:hover{
  border-color:var(--gold);
  background:rgba(240,192,64,0.15);
  box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(240,192,64,0.2);
}

.suggested{
  margin-top:48px;padding-top:28px;
  border-top:1px solid var(--line);
}
.suggested-label{
  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:3px;
  color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:14px;
}
.suggested-grid{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));
  gap:8px;text-align:left;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;
}
.suggested-grid a{
  padding:10px 14px;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;
  color:var(--text-dim);transition:all .15s;
}
.suggested-grid a:hover{
  color:var(--cyan);border-color:rgba(64,192,255,0.3);
  background:rgba(64,192,255,0.04);
}
.suggested-grid a .arrow{color:var(--muted);float:right}

.foot{
  padding:24px;
  border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  text-align:center;
  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);
  letter-spacing:1px;
}
.foot a{color:var(--text-dim)}.foot a:hover{color:var(--gold)}
.foot .sep{margin:0 10px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.15)}

@media(max-width:600px){
  .top-nav{padding:12px 16px;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px}
  .top-nav-links{font-size:10px}
  .stage{padding:36px 18px}
  .transmission{padding:14px 16px;font-size:12px}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<nav class="top-nav">
  <a href="/" class="top-nav-brand">
    <span class="top-nav-brand-icon">GF</span>
    <span>$GFOF</span>
  </a>
  <div class="top-nav-links">
    <a href="/" class="primary">← BACK TO SITE</a>
    <a href="/faq">FAQ ↗</a>
    <a href="/treasury">TREASURY ↗</a>
    <a href="/corrections">CORRECTIONS ↗</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<main class="stage">
  <div class="stage-inner">
    <div class="error-tag">SIGNAL LOST · ROUTE NOT IN INDEX</div>
    <div class="error-code">404</div>
    <h1 class="headline">This transmission does not exist.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      The Federation has searched its registry for the URL you requested. <strong>No matching transmission was found.</strong> Either the address has been deprecated, the link is malformed, or someone is broadcasting on a channel that was never authorized.
    </p>

    <div class="transmission">
      <span class="line"><span class="ts">[FED-NET]</span> Inbound request received</span>
      <span class="line"><span class="ts">[FED-NET]</span> Cross-referencing Federation registry...</span>
      <span class="line"><span class="ts">[FED-NET]</span> <span class="err">No record found.</span></span>
      <span class="line"><span class="ts">[FED-NET]</span> Recommending: <span class="ok">return to known channels</span></span>
      <span class="line"><span class="ts">[FED-NET]</span> <span class="ic">Verify URL · Check official site · DYOR</span></span>
    </div>

    <div class="actions">
      <a href="/" class="btn primary">⬡ RETURN TO HOMEPAGE</a>
      <a href="/faq" class="btn">FAQ ↗</a>
    </div>

    <div class="suggested">
      <div class="suggested-label">// COMMON DESTINATIONS</div>
      <div class="suggested-grid">
        <a href="/treasury">Transparency <span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
        <a href="/liquidation-spec">Lending Spec <span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
        <a href="/corrections">Corrections Log <span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
        <a href="/security">Security <span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
        <a href="/intel">Intel Report <span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
        <a href="/faq">FAQ <span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<div class="foot">
  <a href="/">galacticfederation.co</a>
  <span class="sep">·</span>
  <a href="https://x.com/GFOF_Offcial" target="_blank" rel="noopener">X / Twitter</a>
