  <a href="https://t.me/GFOF_SOL" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Telegram</a>
  <br>
  Galactic Federation of Finance — $GFOF on Solana. Not financial advice. Always DYOR.
</div>

<script>
try {
  console.log('%c⬡ FED-NET · Signal Lost', 'color:#FF5E7B;font-family:monospace;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;padding:3px 8px;border:1px solid #FF5E7B;border-radius:2px;');
  console.log('%c404 · The transmission you requested does not exist.', 'color:#A9B0CC;font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;');
} catch(e) {}
</script>
</body>
</html>
